abstract: >-
  A Grammar of Graphics engine for the terminal, designed for AI coding
  assistants. Every plot is a declarative, JSON-serializable PlotSpec
  consumed by two backends: a terminal ASCII renderer and a Vega-Lite
  converter for interactive, publication-quality output. Provides 66
  geometry types including domain-specific visualizations for genomics
  and clinical research (volcano, Kaplan-Meier, Manhattan, forest, ROC,
  Bland-Altman), a live browser viewer, and integration skills for
  Claude Code.
